  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1">Read `.claude/constraints/bff-extensions.md` + the 011/013/022 notes + `CommunicationEnrichmentService.cs` + `CommunicationClassificationResult.cs` to fix the exact field logical names, the obligations lean-JSON shape, the reviewOutcome value set, the taxonomy lookup, and the shipped write path.</step>
